                                "example_id": "d7b5fbc9-76c4-42ee-b14e-1e48ecf59726",
                                "sense_id": "c8eb2da2-186d-3cc2-b85a-8a30c3ef82ee",
                                "text": "Kane's late leveller will make a big difference to England's morale before two home games against Italy and Hungary, as a second successive loss would have been dispiriting for a side suffering a physical and mental toll after such a long season."
